<title>TUNISIA: SOCCER-TUNISIA BEAT EGYPT 1-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER. [CORRECTED 22:20 GMT]</title>
<headline>SOCCER-TUNISIA BEAT EGYPT 1-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER. [CORRECTED 22:20 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-01-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia beat Egypt 1-0 (halftime</p>
<p>1-0) in a World Cup African zone, group two (corrects from group one) qualifying match on Sunday:</p>
<p>Scorer: Zoubeir Beya (10)</p>
<p>Attendance: 40,000</p>
</text>
